  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4e88477da3f617c468bdb7ee1a7baf06, type: 3}
  m_Name: firstPlantTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialStep
  stepId: firstPlantTutorial
  title: Planting Trees
  body: When you plant a tree it goes through a few stages until it reaches maturity.
    You need to carefully observe the moisture and water it and make sure it can
    survive! The spots next to mature trees conserve more water so it might be smart
    to plant next to them.\n When your tree reaches the mature stage it will automatically
    start planting too!\n You can also use the Remove tool on your seed to remove
    it and add it to your seeds count.
  image: {fileID: 0}
